// Example config — copy to AppConfig.local.xcconfig and wire it as the
// base configuration for the Seedkeep target if you need per-developer
// overrides. The committed defaults already build on a fresh checkout.
//
// For a real-device build you MUST also set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to your
// Apple Developer Team ID. Find it at developer.apple.com → Membership
// (the 10-character "Team ID"). Either copy this file to
// AppConfig.local.xcconfig and set it there (gitignored, safe), or
// set it once in Xcode → Signing & Capabilities (xcodegen will
// preserve it across regenerations as long as you don't overwrite it).

// Bundle identifier. Override per developer to avoid sharing provisioning
// profiles across machines.
PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = app.seedkeep.ios

// Apple Developer Team ID. Required for real-device + archive builds;
// simulator builds tolerate it being empty. This is the same team that
// publishes Joji, SimmerSmith, Open Feelings, and Patchstand.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = K7CBQW6MPG

// Keychain service for the BYOK provider keys. Defaults to the bundle id so
// different environments don't collide.
KEYCHAIN_SERVICE = $(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)
